# Usage:

1. git clone the repository  
2. Enter into the folder where the website is run  
3. Use these commands in terminal  
4. CD into **frontend**  
5. CD into **analytics_board**

and then use:

6. npm install  
7. npm run  

A localhost link will pop up (should look something like http://localhost:1234).

8. Click it  

This will enter you on the website.

9. Within the website, follow the commands given and upload your instagram data. It is best to use all time data to view accurate follower/following information.
